<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Comfort Systems started. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Comfort Systems started. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said Wednesday it started coverage of Comfort Systems USA Inc with a strong buy rating. (Corrects rating from &quot;buy&quot; to &quot;strong buy&quot;.)</p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown was lead underwriter on Comfort Systems' initial public offering, which priced on June 27 at $13 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 17-1/2.</p>
</text>
